# Frontend Rules

## Components
- Use shadcn/ui as the base component library
- Custom components go in /components/shared/
- Always add skeleton loading states for async data
- Always add empty states when lists can be empty
- Always add error states for failed fetches

## Styling
- Tailwind CSS utility classes only
- No custom CSS unless absolutely necessary
- Use cn() from /lib/utils for conditional class merging
- Mobile-first responsive design (sm: md: lg: breakpoints)

## Forms
- Use react-hook-form for all forms
- Connect Zod schema with zodResolver
- Use useServerAction hook to call server actions
- Show inline field errors below each input
- Disable submit button while action is pending
- Show toast on success or error

## Data Fetching
- Fetch data in Server Components where possible
- Use Suspense boundaries with skeleton fallbacks
- Pass data down as props to Client Components
- Use URL searchParams for filter and pagination state